From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thehobbit85 <thehobbit85@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 04:21:59 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] iOS: hide the settings gear during TV play with a controller

Use the layout selected after the game view moves and the active controller state so disconnecting either restores the touch menu. Check both connection orders, hit testing and mapped controller input in the iOS harness.

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#1485
Reason: Hide the in-game menu gear only while a controller is in use and the game picture is on the TV.
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#809
